:: Xavier Ask About Classmate Lucas [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 1>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Xavier",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Xavier: Collections")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> about his opinion of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He is…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> pauses for a moment, choosing his words carefully, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“An interesting person. Used to be quite popular, but now… Well, that’s not my story to tell.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<elseif !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> about his opinion of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>? He would have been a fine asset, had he not mucked it all up. Popular, charming, and quite the looker, don’t you think? Alas, I’m not that interested in damaged goods.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> about his opinion of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Your little friend? Shame, really. He would have made a fine toy, but was not meant to be. First, he followed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span> around like a lost puppy. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> was far too nice a prize for him, but it is what he chose. And now he is suffering for it. Maybe once his reputation is a bit better, I’ll add him to my collection.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

